This repository holds two kinds of material under different licenses.

Player code (each folder's index.html, css/ and js/) is from veo,
https://github.com/terranvigil/veo, and is licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Video and its derived data (each folder's media/ and manifest.json):

- nocturne-4k/: Nocturne (c) Netflix, Inc., Netflix Open Content,
  licensed under CC BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
- sparks-1080p/: Sparks (c) Netflix, Inc., Netflix Open Content,
  licensed under CC BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
- screen-wikipedia/: Wikipedia screen recording by Thomas Daede, released
  under CC0 1.0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/ . The
  page text shown is Wikipedia's, licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0:
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

The excerpts were cut, scaled and re-encoded for these comparisons.
